Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.26,0:00:03.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Shining! Running! Forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.93,0:00:06.70,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep pushing forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:09.63,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,The bond that joins us will never break
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.63,0:00:12.67,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,and its light will shine on the end of our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.67,0:00:15.34,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Wake up! Wake up! Wake up! Wake up heart beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:18.30,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We are the one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:28.07,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Freedom is our only compass we need. -We are best friends-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:28.07,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(760,526)}Translation & initial timing\N{\fs40}Yibis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.07,0:00:34.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We'll be the ones to carve out our own route.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:32.16,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,234)}Timing\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.58,0:00:39.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We spend all our days moving full speed ahead, -Go east, Go west-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:37.60,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(260,384)}Quality-checking\N{\fs40}Sewil\NGalaxy 9000\NHalee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:42.64,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(784,396)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:45.41,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,each day brings something new and we leave nothing unfinished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:48.56,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(188,495)}Video editing         {\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:48.56,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(188,385)}Raw provider      {\fs40}GS-Raws
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.65,0:00:51.20,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Every trial we overcome brings a chance for thrills. (I can't stay)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:56.05,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow and each day after will be heated, intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.05,0:00:59.92,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,A chain of excitements!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:02.49,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's right! Shining! Running! Forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.49,0:01:05.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Trust your curiosity, follow your heart
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.23,0:01:10.70,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,and head for your goal, that's what adventure is all about!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.70,0:01:13.40,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's go shining! Running! Forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.40,0:01:16.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Spread open the chart of your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:19.17,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,There's power hidden in the bond between us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:22.29,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,it'll help us grasp the end of our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:24.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Never! Never! Never! Never stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:30.16,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We are the one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.54,0:01:38.61,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(1058,100)\fad(1500,0)}地下：\N幹部之塔\N內部
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.36,0:01:45.65,Thoughts,Leo,0,0,0,,用這顆塔塔巴巴斯科做的假葡萄，我們就能把砂糖打昏。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.69,0:01:59.73,Title,,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(1200,0)}船長
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.18,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.66,0:02:03.50,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,這是……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.05,0:02:05.80,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,有一隻蒼蠅。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.44,0:02:10.01,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,他射下了一隻蒼蠅。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.01,0:02:14.28,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我一定會讓SOP作戰成功。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.08,0:02:19.58,Thoughts,Leo,0,0,0,,你或許能打中蒼蠅，但打不中我。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.58,0:02:21.13,Thoughts,Leo,0,0,0,,我太快了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:25.88,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,他快到我根本看不見他！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:27.39,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,他或許真能辦到。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.19,0:02:32.63,Thoughts,Leo,0,0,0,,我要你把被抓走的同伴放回來。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:34.52,Thoughts,Gnomes,0,0,0,,上啊，雷奧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.52,0:02:35.94,Thoughts,Gnomes,0,0,0,,我知道你辦得到！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.94,0:02:38.24,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,拜託，一定要成功。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.47,0:02:43.41,Thoughts,Robin,0,0,0,,等等，雷奧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:47.38,Thoughts,Leo,0,0,0,,羅賓蘭？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.38,0:02:50.35,Captions,,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)}地下貿易港
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:55.05,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,這一年來我們都沒有得到任何新工人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.23,0:03:01.72,Main,Grunt,0,0,2,,我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:05.43,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(800,0)}閃亮花\N「優雅向日葵」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:04.29,Main,Grunt,0,0,2,,他們也沒有在王宮裡現身。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.76,0:03:08.76,Main,Grunt,0,0,2,,是誰在偷懶？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.21,0:03:11.64,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(500,0)}人造惡魔果實\NSMILE工廠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.76,0:03:11.64,Main,Gnome,0,0,2,,我、我沒有偷懶！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.91,0:03:24.38,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,他們一定發現自己有五百人不見了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:31.68,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,但他們從不把人往壞處想。頓達塔族真是遲鈍……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.68,0:03:35.00,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,我是說，心地純潔。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.30,0:03:38.48,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,那他們為什麼不現身？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.48,0:03:40.17,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,誰知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.05,0:03:48.67,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,好吧，既然弄不到新工人，我們就只能\N充分利用手上這五百人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:51.33,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,動起來！愛之鞭！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:14.18,Main,Sanshita,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.18,0:04:16.39,Main,Sanshita,0,0,0,,這些SMILE還沒成熟！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:20.86,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,你沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.80,0:04:25.71,Main,Sanshita,0,0,0,,我還以為你們頓達塔族什麼植物都種得出來。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.71,0:04:30.72,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,這、這是沒錯，但SMILE並不是天然的……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.72,0:04:32.12,Main,Sanshita,0,0,0,,不准找藉口！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.05,0:04:36.50,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,請讓我哥哥休息一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:39.14,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,今天的食物壞掉了，所以他……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.14,0:04:41.03,Main,Sanshita,0,0,0,,現在你連食物都要抱怨了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:46.00,Main,Sanshita,0,0,0,,你們不想治好生病的蔓雪莉公主嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.00,0:04:48.48,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,我、我們想！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:51.44,Main,Sanshita,0,0,0,,那就繼續生產SMILE！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.44,0:04:55.44,Main,Sanshita,0,0,0,,這些是能治好她的藥不可或缺的原料。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:05:01.25,Main,Sanshita,0,0,0,,你們每季生產的作物，能用的還不到一成。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.25,0:05:03.75,Main,Sanshita,0,0,0,,給我更努力工作，把過程弄得更有效率！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.75,0:05:07.25,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,能不能讓我們見一見蔓雪莉公主？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.44,0:05:10.06,Main,Sanshita,0,0,0,,不行。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:11.36,Main,Gnomes,0,0,0,,為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.65,0:05:17.86,Main,Sanshita,0,0,0,,要是你們被傳染她的病……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.97,0:05:21.58,Main,Sanshita,0,0,0,,……我們大家都會哭的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.58,0:05:25.57,Main,Sanshita,0,0,0,,你們頓達塔族是我們無可取代的夥伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:32.48,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,三、三下大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:35.24,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,我們會盡一切努力！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.24,0:05:38.97,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,請好好照顧我們的公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.97,0:05:41.46,Main,Sanshita,0,0,0,,那當然！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:44.59,Thoughts,Sanshita,0,0,0,,他們怎麼會相信這麼露骨的謊言？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:48.66,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,你、你在做什麼，羅賓蘭？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:54.16,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,抱歉。但你要是就這樣衝進去，早就被殺了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:56.69,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我看過那隻蒼蠅的屍體。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.10,0:06:03.50,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,儘管牠那麼小，他還是精準地打中了牠的眉心。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.50,0:06:07.35,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,托雷波爾的動態視力異常驚人。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:12.64,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,在他還守著砂糖的時候去對付她，太危險了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:18.12,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那你打算怎麼辦，羅賓蘭？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:21.96,Main,,0,0,0,,這邊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.43,0:06:27.81,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,喂，這箱子是怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.81,0:06:30.90,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,是一群粉紅色的蜜蜂！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.02,0:06:36.78,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我有消息要報告，托雷波爾大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.06,0:06:44.18,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,伊夫斯船長的手下在四號港口起了騷動。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.66,0:06:48.65,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,他們要求跟幹部談交易的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:56.60,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,既然他們不怕喬卡的名號，\N那他們一定很有膽量。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:03.54,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,喂，換班了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.27,0:07:08.47,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,平常的守衛現在去吃午飯了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.44,0:07:10.54,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,這是緊急情況！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:13.04,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我們有好幾個人受傷了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:14.21,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,請幫幫我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:19.52,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,受傷？我來了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:26.69,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,喂，喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.57,0:07:29.38,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,托雷波爾大人！您要出去嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:32.89,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,加強幹部之塔那四扇門的警戒。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:33.89,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,是，遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:38.34,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,一有狀況立刻通知我。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.34,0:07:39.35,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,呃……是，遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.74,0:07:45.80,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,托雷波爾大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:47.31,Main,Grunt,0,0,0,,辛苦您了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.31,0:07:48.98,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,喂，喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:52.36,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,在哪裡？打鬥在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.36,0:07:53.29,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,四號港口。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.65,0:07:56.82,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,什麼？你不打嗎，騙人蘭？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.53,0:07:59.69,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我要應付這種場面是輕而易舉，不過……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:03.43,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,什麼都不做才不會傷到我。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.43,0:08:07.60,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,……我要藉由守護你，給你信心！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:09.17,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,信心？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.17,0:08:13.64,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,別擔心！要是出了什麼差錯，我會救你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:15.54,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,那真是太令人安心了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.28,0:08:19.34,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,是誰在那裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:28.27,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,放棄吧，砂糖！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:33.09,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我們是來奪回被關在工廠裡的同伴的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.96,0:08:37.06,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,而且我們要把你打昏！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.06,0:08:38.93,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,打昏？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.24,0:08:43.54,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,我不知道你們同伴的任何事。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:44.21,Main,Gnomes,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:45.44,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:47.09,Main,Gnomes,0,0,0,,{\i1}什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:47.76,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,真的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:48.91,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,那好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.91,0:08:50.98,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,一點都不好！別被她騙了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.98,0:08:54.38,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,好、好險！把我們的同伴還來！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.42,0:09:02.40,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,是誰告訴你們這些的？你們顯然蠢到連自己被騙了都不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.82,0:09:09.13,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,我還在納悶，為什麼這一年來\N都沒在王宮看見頓達塔族。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.03,0:09:14.03,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,原來是因為有人一直在欺騙你們。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:16.84,Main,Gnomes,0,0,0,,{\i1}住口！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.84,0:09:19.00,Main,Gnomes,0,0,0,,把她按住，撬開她的嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:23.34,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,真無禮。感覺你們好像\N太小看我了……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.70,0:09:34.69,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}小熊玩具！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:42.49,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,該來訂契約了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:45.30,Thoughts,Flapper,0,0,0,,糟了！她把我們變成玩具了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:51.20,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,聽從我的命令，直到你們死為止。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.20,0:09:54.41,Thoughts,Flapper,0,0,0,,我們大家都被遺忘了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:55.76,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:58.22,Main,Bomba,0,0,0,,不知從哪冒出一堆玩具。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:10:00.40,Main,Cotton,0,0,0,,我們剛才在做什麼來著？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.02,0:10:04.65,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,把闖進幹部之塔的入侵者全部屠殺掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.65,0:10:06.95,Thoughts,Flapper,0,0,0,,我無法違抗她的命令！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.95,0:10:10.16,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,把他們全都屠殺掉……連我也一樣嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:17.03,Thoughts,Gnome,0,0,0,,不要！我不想打！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:19.86,Main,Bomba,0,0,0,,那些一定是砂糖的部下！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.86,0:10:23.50,Main,Cotton,0,0,0,,真不敢相信她除了托雷波爾之外還有其他援兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:26.61,Main,Flapper,0,0,0,,雷奧！是我，芙拉帕！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.61,0:10:29.07,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,打倒敵方士兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.04,0:10:34.90,Thoughts,Flapper,0,0,0,,不！不！不！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:37.65,Thoughts,Flapper,0,0,0,,{\i1}不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:42.22,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,托雷波爾，回來！這是陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.08,0:10:45.00,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,托雷波爾！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.09,0:10:47.63,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,陷阱？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.01,0:10:50.33,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,喂，你！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.33,0:10:52.83,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,您看那邊，托雷波爾大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:56.13,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,那些海賊在鬧事。我們對付不了他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.06,0:11:02.64,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,喂，喂，你！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.29,0:11:04.94,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,出了什麼問題？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.94,0:11:06.61,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,托雷波爾大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.61,0:11:08.28,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,喂，怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.28,0:11:13.95,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,呃，其實也不算什麼問題……\N只是貨物裡有一堆蜜蜂而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:17.46,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,交易沒有任何問題。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.38,0:11:20.29,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,那個女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:27.86,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,喂，喂，等等，等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.86,0:11:29.37,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,你！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.37,0:11:32.97,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,喂，你是誰？喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.62,0:11:42.05,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,她消失了！喂！喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:45.04,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,不過等等……那張臉……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.99,0:11:50.77,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,她是草帽一夥的人嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:52.41,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,她怎麼會來到這裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.41,0:11:54.69,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,托雷波爾！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:56.60,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,他們為什麼要找砂糖？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.60,0:11:59.66,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,給我回來！你被騙了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.66,0:12:00.82,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,去死吧，你這蠢貨！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:03.90,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,現在我火大了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.82,0:12:09.74,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}黏黏鎖鏈！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.41,0:12:18.13,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}黏黏棍……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.51,0:22:43.34,Main,Toy,0,0,0,,咦？那是什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.71,0:12:25.55,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}流星！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.33,0:12:43.38,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,托、托雷波爾大人發狂了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.50,0:12:49.95,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,幹部之塔被壓垮了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:21.72,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,騙人布，騙人布，振作點。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.35,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.35,0:13:28.86,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,羅賓{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:32.36,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,發、發生什麼事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.36,0:13:33.79,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,一隻鴨子突然從天花板上掉下來。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:36.13,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,雷奧他們被抓走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.03,0:13:39.45,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,還有其他人，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.81,0:13:41.17,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,對吧，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.17,0:13:42.57,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,他們叫什麼名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:44.90,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我絕對不會說！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.90,0:13:48.65,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,沒錯，別告訴他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.65,0:13:50.84,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,趁還能走的時候趕快離開這裡吧，羅賓。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.44,0:13:54.45,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,你看，那傢伙是我朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.89,0:13:58.15,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,我記得他的名字好像是……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.15,0:13:59.72,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,喔，你是說騙人蘭？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:01.65,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.65,0:14:05.83,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,你這白痴，他才不是我朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.83,0:14:08.39,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,可惡，你騙了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.39,0:14:11.00,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,那個獨腳士兵也是你們的人嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:13.52,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我、我不會說的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:15.17,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,我們已經知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.17,0:14:17.24,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,既然你們已經知道了，那再隱瞞也沒意義了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.24,0:14:18.65,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,他是我們的同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.65,0:14:20.39,Main,Sugar,0,0,0,,我就知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.39,0:14:21.47,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,可惡。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.47,0:14:25.94,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,我開始把一切串起來了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:30.95,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,就算你把一切都想通了，你也完蛋了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.67,0:14:35.93,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我們一定會奪回我們的夥伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.91,0:14:43.16,Main,Trébol,0,0,0,,那些黏黏的東西還是可燃的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:58.89,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,現在又是怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.89,0:15:00.75,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,托雷波爾大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.49,0:15:11.62,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,雷奧，雷奧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:16.01,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們走……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.01,0:15:17.96,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我是說，你們必須離開這裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.57,0:15:20.30,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你們沒辦法再往前了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.77,0:15:22.67,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你們對付不了托雷波爾的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.08,0:15:30.11,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我們……做不到。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.34,0:15:40.52,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我必須……趕快完成……SOP作戰……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.52,0:15:45.99,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,然後船長就會……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.91,0:15:51.00,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,替我們打敗多佛朗明哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.40,0:15:59.44,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,船長在等我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.28,0:16:03.01,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我得趕快。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.52,0:16:13.65,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(260,100)}王宮，\N一樓升降梯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.03,0:16:22.43,Main,,0,0,0,,船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.58,0:16:32.60,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(1056,100)\fad(500,0)}今天早上\N於德雷斯羅薩。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.91,0:16:32.60,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,多佛朗明哥大人要辭去七武海之位？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:37.04,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,他也要退位嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.35,0:16:46.00,Main,Prisoner,0,0,0,,他現在只是個普通海賊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.00,0:16:48.96,Main,Prisoner,0,0,0,,現在他會被海軍追捕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.96,0:16:50.92,Main,Prisoner,0,0,0,,我們要自由了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.92,0:16:53.53,Main,Gnomes,0,0,0,,船長，你看報紙了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.53,0:16:56.26,Main,Inhel,0,0,0,,現在我們的同伴會回來了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:58.78,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我們終究不用打仗了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.78,0:16:59.41,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,真是鬆了口——
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:04.80,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,不，那是假消息。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:08.64,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,不會吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.68,0:17:13.38,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,那是誤報，我太高興了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:18.57,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,像他那麼了不起的人，不可能就這樣放棄王位的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.57,0:17:20.19,Main,Citizen,0,0,0,,多佛朗明哥大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.19,0:17:23.82,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,我要參加今天的比賽，拿到火火果實。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.82,0:17:27.13,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,然後我要殺了多佛朗明哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.13,0:17:29.89,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,蕾貝卡，冷靜點。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.43,0:17:33.13,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我明白你的憤怒。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.13,0:17:35.05,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我也有同樣的感受……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.05,0:17:37.04,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,但別做傻事。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:38.97,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,該去戰鬥的人是我們。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:40.81,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,一切都準備好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.45,0:17:43.68,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,不，我不要等！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:47.51,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,我們從天堂被推入了地獄。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.51,0:17:49.75,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,大家都到極限了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:50.78,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,他們的意志都被摧毀了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.99,0:17:59.18,Flashbacks,Prisoner,0,0,0,,難道我們只能靜靜等待處決之日的到來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.33,0:18:05.17,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,贏了一千場比賽就能重獲自由？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:07.33,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,那根本不是希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.33,0:18:08.72,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,那是絕望之牆！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:13.16,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,那個有三千勝的傳說鬥劍士，居魯士？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:16.64,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,大家都知道那座雕像是假的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.64,0:18:20.98,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,居魯士只是垂死的囚犯們幻想出來的理想戰士。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:25.68,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,那座雕像裝滿了他們想成功、\N想從這裡逃出去的願望。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.65,0:18:29.98,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,與其把希望寄託在愚蠢的夢想上，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.98,0:18:35.29,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,我寧願賭在今天的比賽上！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.29,0:18:36.69,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,怎麼可能有機會！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.15,0:18:40.10,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,你根本不可能贏。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.10,0:18:43.71,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,你只是在白白送死！我不准你參賽！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.71,0:18:45.37,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,你太衝動了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:47.44,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,你才十六歲！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:50.46,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,你以為自己是大人了嗎，蕾貝卡？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.46,0:18:52.80,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,你還是個孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.80,0:18:54.38,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,聽我的話！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:19:00.18,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,別再說得好像你是我父親一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.05,0:19:04.07,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,是你自己在激動。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:05.62,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,什麼計畫？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.62,0:19:08.58,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,你根本不可能打敗多佛朗明哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.58,0:19:13.06,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,你只是個獨腳玩具！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:18.56,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,的確……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.81,0:19:21.56,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,你說得對。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.41,0:19:24.61,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,不，等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.79,0:19:28.14,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我可能說得太過分了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.14,0:19:31.28,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,但拜託你，別參賽。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.28,0:19:32.80,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,我不是那個意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:35.48,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,士兵先生，等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:38.92,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,等等！士兵先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.92,0:19:43.95,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,我是怕你會死才害怕的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.95,0:19:46.01,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.01,0:19:48.38,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,等等，士兵先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:52.41,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,士兵先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:08.45,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,哎呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.92,0:20:16.09,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,從不主動出擊的蕾貝卡，居然開始進攻了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.58,0:20:18.96,Main,Diamante,0,0,0,,那把劍是怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.53,0:20:22.50,Main,Diamante,0,0,0,,沒有刀刃。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.50,0:20:25.07,Main,Diamante,0,0,0,,這裡是殺戮的競技場。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.47,0:20:28.91,Main,Diamante,0,0,0,,你要是不砍別人，就等著被砍。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.27,0:20:32.57,Main,Diamante,0,0,0,,那才能炒熱觀眾的情緒。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.57,0:20:33.59,Main,Diamante,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鎖定！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.13,0:20:47.19,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,正中目標！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.60,0:20:51.10,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,那個不敗的女人完全無力招架！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.60,0:20:53.97,Main,Audience,0,0,0,,帝雅曼鐵！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.71,0:20:55.40,Main,Sabo,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:57.71,Main,Sabo,0,0,0,,喂，肌肉瓜！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.71,0:20:59.52,Main,Bartolomeo,0,0,0,,是巴特洛馬。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.52,0:21:01.04,Main,Sabo,0,0,0,,保護那個女孩。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.91,0:21:09.05,Main,Diamante,0,0,0,,蕾貝卡，你知道你母親絲卡蕾特是怎麼死的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.92,0:21:15.22,Flashbacks,Scarlett,0,0,0,,我去弄點吃的來給我們。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.25,0:21:22.66,Main,Diamante,0,0,0,,那個玩具士兵哭的樣子真是可悲。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.48,0:21:26.35,Flashbacks,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,對不起，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.35,0:21:30.44,Flashbacks,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,我沒能保護好你母親！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.84,0:21:36.64,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(224,100)}王宮一樓\N升降梯外
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.20,0:21:40.74,Main,Lao G,0,0,0,,這震動……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.24,0:21:44.39,Main,Lao G,0,0,0,,一定是皮卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.39,0:21:46.18,Main,Lao G,0,0,0,,他為什麼在暴走？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.16,0:21:51.41,Main,Gnome,0,0,0,,我們不會讓你們跟去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.99,0:21:53.78,Main,Kabu,0,0,0,,你沒事吧，船長？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.78,0:21:55.29,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,謝、謝了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.29,0:21:56.56,Main,Kabu,0,0,0,,我們得趕快。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.56,0:21:59.10,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,等等，他們會死的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.10,0:22:02.20,Main,Lao G,0,0,0,,放開我，你們這些該死的小矮人！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.20,0:22:05.15,Main,Kabu,0,0,0,,看前面，船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.39,0:22:09.28,Main,Kabu,0,0,0,,我們從一開始就有覺悟了。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.28,0:22:10.37,Main,Thunder Soldier,0,0,0,,別傻了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.37,0:22:12.68,Main,Kabu,0,0,0,,要是你到不了，那會怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.72,0:22:23.55,Main,Kabu,0,0,0,,就算雷奧他們完成了SOP作戰，如果我們不打敗多佛朗明哥，什麼都不會改變！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.55,0:22:28.49,Main,Rampo,0,0,0,,能殺多佛朗明哥的只有你一個人啊，船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.50,0:22:34.87,Captions,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(1060,100)\fad(1000,0)}地下貿易港\N幹部之塔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.99,0:22:31.76,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,雷奧，你們的船長是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.76,0:22:34.87,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你們為什麼把一切都賭在他身上？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.00,0:22:40.07,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他只是個獨腳玩具啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.47,0:22:50.88,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,新的玩具被變出來時，會被一份\N封鎖其反抗意志的契約所束縛。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.41,0:22:56.41,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,但我們船長是這個國家最早被造出來的玩具……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.41,0:23:04.18,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,砂糖犯了錯，沒有強迫他訂契約。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.18,0:23:17.20,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,就因為十年前那一個失誤，他是唯一能違抗唐吉訶德家族的玩具。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.58,0:23:27.42,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,所以這十年來，船長一直孤軍奮戰。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.42,0:23:35.09,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,若不是有他，玩具們只能哭著入睡。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.88,0:23:40.06,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我們頓達塔族根本不會察覺任何異狀。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.06,0:23:45.84,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,我們全都會被變成他們的奴隸。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.76,0:23:57.28,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,要是我們無視他的吶喊，這個國家就沒救了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.14,0:24:06.19,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,他值得我們賭上一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.88,0:24:13.11,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,現在沒有人記得他了……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.11,0:24:16.62,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,但很久以前，人人都知道他的名字。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.62,0:24:20.30,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,當他還是個高大的人類時，他的名字是……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.30,0:24:22.51,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,居魯士！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.17,0:24:27.52,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,鬥技場史上最強的鬥劍士！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.18,0:24:33.55,Main,Leo,0,0,0,,他就是我們的船長！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,

